referenceFunction.generalComment:
The functional unit represent 1 kg of anhydrous chloromethyl methyl ether.  Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak and aged data on the production process and missing data on process emissions.;
CAS number: 000107-30-2; 
Formula: C2H5ClO; 
Synonyms: CMME, Chlorodimethyl ether, Chlordimethylether, Dimethylchloroether, chloromethoxymethane, Methyl chloromethyl ether, Monochlorodimethyl ether, Methoxymethyl chloride, HSDB 908; 
UUID: 2f54f23b-c0a9-3bc9-aa62-3e5ff665702d
